    "result_text": "The full suite is a single test class (`AcceptanceBase` is abstract, `AuditLogCapture` is a helper), and it's green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented `telephoneDisplay` \u2014 the human-formatted rendering of the stored E.164 telephone, while `telephone` stays raw E.164.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `telephoneDisplay` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema (the DTO is generated from this spec at build time, producing `OwnerDto.getTelephoneDisplay()`/`setTelephoneDisplay()`).\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a `@Mapping(target = \"telephoneDisplay\", ... qualifiedByName = \"toTelephoneDisplay\")` and a `toTelephoneDisplay(Owner)` method that:\n   - Returns the value unchanged (untouched `telephone`) when it's null or not a well-formed E.164 number.\n   - Otherwise splits off the country code (`1` for NANP `+1`, two digits otherwise \u2014 covering the `+61` numbers the app stores), then emits `+<cc>` a space, and the national digits grouped in threes.\n\nFor the tested input `\"0412 345 678\"` \u2192 stored `telephone` `+61412345678` \u2192 `telephoneDisplay` `+61 412 345 678`.\n\n`Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 **BUILD SUCCESS**.",
